    <section class="band about-intro" id="about" data-page="about">
      <div class="wrap about-intro-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="about-eyebrow">About Us</p>
          <h1>Welcome to Sun Son Solar</h1>
          <p>Sun Son Solar has been growing under the Philippine sun for more than 25 years. What started as a small family shop selling solar panels and inverters in Pasig City has become a full-service solar company that designs, installs, and looks after systems for homes, shops, offices, and warehouses across Metro Manila and nearby provinces.</p>
          <p>Our promise to every customer is simple: <b>electricity is a basic part of modern life, and Sun Son Solar helps you keep the lights on, at any time of day, with clean power from your own roof.</b></p>
        </div>
        <ul class="about-stats" aria-label="Company highlights">
          <li><b>25+</b><span>Years of experience</span></li>
          <li><b>3,500+</b><span>Systems installed</span></li>
          <li><b>40+</b><span>Trained technicians and engineers</span></li>
          <li><b>98%</b><span>Customer satisfaction</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band about-mvv" id="mission" data-page="about">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Mission, Vision &amp; Motto</h2>
        <div class="mvv-grid">
          <article class="mvv-card"><div class="mvv-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3"/></svg></div><h3>Our Mission</h3><p>To make dependable solar power affordable for every Filipino household and business by supplying quality-tested products, honest advice, and service that does not end after installation.</p></article>
          <article class="mvv-card"><div class="mvv-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Our Vision</h3><p>To be the most trusted name in solar energy in the Philippines, a company known for clean power, fair prices, and long-lasting relationships with the people we serve.</p></article>
          <article class="mvv-card"><div class="mvv-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-8-5.500-8-11a4.500 4.500 0 0 1 8-2.800A4.500 4.500 0 0 1 20 10c0 5.500-8 11-8 11z"/></svg></div><h3>Our Motto</h3><p>Customer satisfaction first. We keep our business honest and open, supply quality products in large volumes at fair prices, and earn a deserved profit by doing right by our customers.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band about-recog" id="recognition" data-page="about">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">Certifications &amp; Awards</h2>
        <div class="recog-grid">
          <article class="recog-card"><div class="mvv-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.500-3.400 8-8 9-4.600-1-8-4.500-8-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><div><h3>ISO 9001 Quality Certification</h3><p>Our quality management system is certified to ISO 9001 standards. For our team this was a turning point: it put clear, checked procedures behind every product we supply and every installation we complete.</p></div></article>
          <article class="recog-card"><div class="mvv-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"/><path d="M8.500 14L7 22l5-3 5 3-1.500-8"/></svg></div><div><h3>Customer Choice Award</h3><p>A regional consumer group honored Sun Son Solar for quality product distribution and dependable after-sales service, one of the proudest moments in our history.</p></div></article>
        </div>
