    <section class="band about-story" id="journey" data-page="about">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Journey</h2>
        <ol class="timeline">
          <li><b>2000</b><div><h3>A small shop in Pasig</h3><p>Our family opens a shop selling solar panels, inverters, and batteries.</p></div></li>
          <li><b>2009</b><div><h3>Installation team formed</h3><p>We add our own installers and begin offering complete design and installation services.</p></div></li>
          <li><b>2016</b><div><h3>Commercial projects</h3><p>Shops, offices, and warehouses join our customers, and our first large rooftop system goes live.</p></div></li>
          <li><b>2023</b><div><h3>Monitoring and care plans</h3><p>We launch remote monitoring and yearly maintenance, so every customer's system stays in top shape.</p></div></li>
