        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <details><summary>Is the quote really free?</summary><p>Yes. Request a free quote from your account and we will schedule a site visit. The final price is confirmed after the visit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How much does a solar system cost?</summary><p>It depends on your roof, your electricity use, and whether you add a battery. We confirm the exact price in your quote after a free site visit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does installation take?</summary><p>It depends on the system size and the permits. We confirm a schedule with you after the site visit.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do the panels need maintenance?</summary><p>Panels work best when clean and checked from time to time. We offer one-time cleaning visits, an annual service plan, and repairs.</p></details>
        <details><summary>My system is not producing power. What should I do?</summary><p>Check the inverter display or app for an alert, and note any error code. Do not open the equipment yourself. Call or email us with what you see and we will arrange a diagnosis.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How quickly will you reply?</summary><p>We reply to calls, emails, and online requests within one business day. Office hours are Monday to Saturday, 8:00 AM to 5:00 PM.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do I get help?</summary><p>Call or email us using the details in the Contact section, or visit our office during office hours.</p></details>
